      "id": "IRW-01",
      "title": "The row count is the determinant index of an inverse-image lattice",
      "chapter": "lifts",
      "anchor": "lifts-inert-row",
      "statement": "In the local unramified setting with residue cardinal q² and middle rank m, write h=v(det C) for the length of the middle unitary block and take an integer e≥0. For integral C of nonzero determinant, the row lattice Λ={r:rϖ^e C∈𝒪^m} contains 𝒪^m and [Λ:𝒪^m]=q^{2(h+me)}.",
